  "title": "Fresh Peach and Strawberry Salad",
  "blurb": "A simple fruit salad with ripe peaches, strawberries and kiwi, brightened with a squeeze of lemon juice.",
  "steps": [
    "Halve the peaches, remove the stones, and cut the flesh into bite-sized wedges.",
